ower up by creating destruction, finding and eating humans and more. Oh, and look out for human cameos as you unleash chaos! Choose if you want to eat them or set them free.", "short_description": "Go big and unleash chaos and destruction. As a kaju monster you\u2019ll smash through towering skyscrapers, throw tanks and swat attacking drones with the goal of making each cities\u2019 polluting power plants go boom! "}]}, "developer_name": "Dark Slope Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.darkslope.com/legal/ms3000", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dark Slope Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.darkslope.com/games", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9118294791556770"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2974400576032019"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2974400576032019"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1734541200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2974400576032019"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9152561691463413", "version": "1.0.59261"}, "id": "566991291845306", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__i